          "fields": {
            "rarity": "4 \u2605",
            "type": "Thugs"
          },
          "text": "Psychological evaluation: abnormal, irreparable\u2014no matter how low he bowed his head, no matter how many tears he shed, nothing could change the outcome written in his death sentence. Then came the Hol"
